2;\"><div>1. 双重乱斗属于DC的高福利活动，请各位重视，只要不是刚刚入坑的都可以有比较好的奖励可以拿。</div><div>2. 并不是非要15个高练度的角色才能玩，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">只要你有一套五人的PVP队伍</span>前11场都很容易，只有12胜的那一场有点难度。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">我们的目标是：资源投入第一排，第二批第三排随便赛点人进去。95%的玩家都没有15套装备、魂卡、附魔。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3. 没把握12胜的，6月9日上午10点，第一时间进行游戏，乱斗刚开始没有玩家的时候都是机器人，并且很多人没有配好队伍，是拿12胜最简单的时间点，切记切记。</span></span></div></span><div></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">配队</span></span></p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">理想中的队伍Buff组合：双加速+无敌盾+异常盾+坚毅盾+减cd+不死。</span></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">队长的选择</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">1. 如果你有嫦娥玩偶</span></span></span></span></span></span><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">+</span><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/496659.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/496659.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 40px; height: 40px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">2. 否则</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">众生平等！对方队长技能无效，专打嫦娥和有强力队长玩偶的。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">此卡不需要练</span></span>，5星1级即可上场，放到第三排用她的队长技能即可。（如果能给配个白斩鸡玩偶则更完美<img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/871275.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/871275.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:40px;height:40px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/371363.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/371363.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">没有上面的卡时上（不会一张都没吧，光rd刚过，都有光五星券吧），遇到嫦娥时，劣势，当然也不可能有多少人有嫦娥，配合白斩鸡效果更好。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">总结：<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">&nbsp;</span><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/871275.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/871275.png\" style=\"font-size: 16px; width: 40px; height: 40px;\">&nbsp; &gt;<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/496659.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/496659.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 40px; height: 40px;\">&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/758911.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">&nbsp;&gt;<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/443608.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\">=<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/371363.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/371363.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"></span></span></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">加速</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><span style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(202, 200, 207);\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div><span style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(202, 200, 207);\">不考虑冷门角色。</span></div>技能充能量：</span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/416059.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/416059.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">4体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">充能量+异常闪避率+闪避率</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/444808.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/444808.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\">4体充能量+4体异常盾（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">限定</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">火属性</span>）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/243764.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/243764.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">4体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">充能量+3体异常盾</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/640114.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/640114.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">3体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">充能量+减cd</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\">技能充能速度：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/662679.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/662679.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">4体填充速度+无敌盾（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">限定火属性</span>）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/737794.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/737794.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">3体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">填充速度+技能攻击力</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/502271.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/502271.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">6体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">填充速度</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/485399.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/485399.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">4体<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">填充速度+攻击力<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">（</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">限定光属性</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">）</span></span></div></div></span></span></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div><br></div><div>推荐组合：</div></span><div></div><div><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/444808.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/444808.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/662679.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/662679.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:80px;height:80px;\">&nbsp;双加速 + 异常盾 + 无敌盾（最强组合，火队专属）</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">其他根据自己练度随意组合即可。</span></div><div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13.9999px;\">不死</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"\">还剩这两个：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/690477.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/8/690477.png\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;\"><img data-width